tool_input.command:
perl -0pi -e '
s/### Task 2 - #45\x27s event\n\nThis task is task 3 in the numbering below, but it runs first, under decision 6\.\n\n//;
s/### Task 3 - #45 given/### Task 2 - #45 given/;
s/### Task 4 - the tracker change/### Task 3 - the tracker change/;
s/on top of task 3\x27s result/on top of task 2\x27s result/;
s/apart from a kept task\n3 change/apart from a kept task\n2 change/;
s/record it, and go to task 5\./record it, and go to task 4./;
s/### Task 5 - the record/### Task 4 - the record/;
s/at task 6\x27s exit/at task 5\x27s exit/;
s/### Task 6 - the exit round/### Task 5 - the exit round/;
s/\nThe tasks are numbered 0 to 6\. Task 2 is only the pointer above, so the report counts \*tasks 0\nto 6\*\.\n//;
s/at task N of 6,/at task N of 5,/;
s/task 3\x27s #45 event first/task 2\x27s #45 event first/;
s/\(decision 4, task 3\)/(decision 4, task 2)/;
' WORK_INSTRUCTIONS.md && grep -n "Task [0-9]\|task [0-9]" WORK_INSTRUCTIONS.md
